fang2/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/7to9gsgorif8usnp2v2rezt3a02q3bq.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_1036_fang2/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/ec5l66sbl43hi8l3l30kr23gwppcvev.mp3","text":"新年好呀，博士。过去一年真忙啊，跟着罗德岛去了不少地方，也经历了不少事。新的一年，一起加油吧！","alt":"voice/char_1036_fang2/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/jyfive2pr8sd996w6vw4ok8xel2c49v.mp3","text":"我一直在您身边，博士。","alt":"voice/char_1036_fang2/cn_042.mp3"}]}}